        <div class="fc-delta-reason">New forecast replacing F4 (resolved NO at &ge;30/day by Oct 3) with a lower threshold (15/day, ~18% of pre-war normal) and longer horizon (Nov 30). F4 resolved NO convincingly: ~1 transit on Sep 27, 139 vessels waiting outside berths, five strikes in one week near the Strait. Probability at 0.22 reflects: remote but non-trivial chance Iran-US diplomacy produces a partial deal in the next 56 days; Iran&rsquo;s stated goal of reopening Hormuz as part of any deal; but Trump&rsquo;s post-midterm escalation threat, the nuclear sequencing gap, and 139 vessels still waiting as structurally opposing forces.</div>
        <dl class="fc-meta-row">
